      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "There was plenty of merit in last week's resuming performance of THE NITESHIFT (1) when he led from this barrier and stuck on well for a 1.6m second. The distance rise is some query but he owns a strong record here and won his lone second-up attempt so should be improved. WICKED CONFESSION (3) came from this barrier when less than 6m behind THE NITESHIFT in fourth last week and beat some good mares in winning here prior. First try at this distance but she is going well. GUNNA RELOAD (2) draws much better than when second to WICKED CONFESSION last start and won both rounds of the Breeders Challenge 4M series prior. Races well at this longer distance so is a player. JUNGLE DRAGON (8) draws wide but was brave last week, sticking on to place after racing parked. Respect. SINALOA (7) has had no luck when caught wide in both starts since placing here. Include.",
